  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFC implemented Multi-Donor Fund to support the Ethiopia Investment Climate Programme (EICP) which aims to improve the business environment in Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity IFC implemented Multi-Donor Fund to support the Ethiopia Investment Climate Programme (EICP) which aims to improve the business environment in Ethiopia.  is a component of Private Enterprise Programme Ethiopia reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,073,475. It works in the following sector(s): Sectors not specified, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development.</narrative>
  </description>
